# TeamSync REST API Integration Documentation (`apiguide`)

Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api
Authentication Standard: JSON Web Token (JWT) Bearer Authentication
Content-Type: application/json (or multipart/form-data for file uploads)

================================================================================
GLOBAL REQUEST HEADERS
================================================================================
- Content-Type: application/json (or multipart/form-data for uploads)
- Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

================================================================================
COMMON HTTP STATUS CODES
================================================================================
- 200 OK: Request succeeded.
- 201 Created: Resource created successfully.
- 400 Bad Request: Validation error or missing required fields.
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing JWT token.
- 403 Forbidden: Insufficient role permissions.
- 404 Not Found: Resource ID not found.

================================================================================
1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS (/api/auth/)
================================================================================
1.1 LOGIN: POST /api/auth/login/
1.2 REGISTER: POST /api/auth/register/
1.3 CURRENT USER: GET /api/auth/me/
1.4 LIST USERS: GET /api/auth/users/

================================================================================
2. PROJECT ENDPOINTS (/api/projects/)
================================================================================
2.1 LIST PROJECTS: GET /api/projects/
2.2 CREATE PROJECT: POST /api/projects/
2.3 MEMBER MANAGEMENT: POST /api/projects/{id}/add_member/

================================================================================
3. TASK ENDPOINTS & OPTIONAL ENHANCEMENTS (/api/tasks/)
================================================================================
3.1 LIST & FILTER TASKS: GET /api/tasks/?project=1&status=IN_PROGRESS&priority=URGENT&assigned_to_me=true
3.2 CREATE TASK: POST /api/tasks/
3.3 UPDATE TASK & DEADLINE AUDIT: PATCH /api/tasks/{id}/
    Behavior: Logs DeadlineHistory, records TaskActivity, sends Email notification to assignee.

3.4 TASK DEADLINE HISTORY: GET /api/tasks/{id}/deadline_history/

3.5 TASK ACTIVITY HISTORY LOG (Optional Enhancement): GET /api/tasks/{id}/activity_history/
Returns chronological audit log of status changes, reassignments, deadline changes, comments, and file attachments.

3.6 TASK COMMENTS: GET / POST /api/tasks/{id}/comments/

3.7 TASK FILE ATTACHMENTS (Optional Enhancement): GET / POST /api/tasks/{id}/attachments/
Allows uploading file attachments to tasks and fetching file metadata & download URLs.

3.8 DASHBOARD STATS: GET /api/tasks/dashboard_stats/
